    <p>The RTX 5070 clears our 1440p estimate on speed and on its 12 GB of video memory: it averaged about 104 frames a second in Cyberpunk 2077 at 1440p in its launch review. For 4K we think 12 GB is the limit rather than raw speed. It supports every DLSS feature, including Multi Frame Generation.</p>
